# 215 K mW liquid. n is the number of simple-cubic cells on an edge.
# n=8 is 512 molecules, n=16 is 4096, n=32 is 32768.
# Number density 0.033 /A^3. The velocity seed is 215.
# One OpenMP thread keeps the trajectory fixed for that seed.

variable n index 8
variable rho equal 0.033
variable L equal (v_n*v_n*v_n/v_rho)^(1.0/3.0)
variable a equal v_L/v_n

units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
atom_modify map array

lattice sc ${a}
region box block 0 ${n} 0 ${n} 0 ${n}
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box

mass 1 18.015
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

timestep 10.0
thermo 1000
velocity all create 500.0 215 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 500.0 500.0 200.0
run 3000
unfix 1
fix 1 all nvt temp 215.0 215.0 200.0
run 5000

write_dump all custom liquid.lammpstrj id type x y z modify sort id
